# Who reviews what.
#
# The governance core, the shape gate and the spec are the project's meaning, not its plumbing: a
# change to any of them can change what the fleet is allowed to do, so it needs the maintainer and
# not only a passing CI run. This file only asks for a review — it does not grant one, and it does
# not replace the rule that no change to the licence or the open-source/hosted boundary happens
# without a dated `DECISIONS.md` row first.

